2
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Tinker Bell and the Legend of the NeverBeast is a adventure,
animation, family film directed by Steve Loter.

3
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
An ancient myth of a massive creature sparks the curiosity of Tinker Bell and her good friend
Fawn, an animal fairy who’s not afraid to break the rules to help an animal in need.

4
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:46,000
But this creature is not welcome in Pixie Hollow — and the scout fairies are determined
to capture the mysterious beast, who they fear will destroy their home.

5
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:26,000
Fawn must convince her fairy friends to risk
everything to rescue the NeverBeast.

6
