12
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Tinker Bell and the Legend of the NeverBeast is a 2015 American
animated fantasy film directed by Steve Loter.

13
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:46,000
It is the sixth installment in the Tinker Bell film series,
based on the character Tinker Bell from J.

14
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:26,000
Barrie's Peter Pan.

15
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
This was the final feature film to be produced by Disneytoon
Studios three years before its closure on June 28, 2018.

16
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
It is also the last of the direct to video Disney
follow-ups after a 21-year-long run.

17
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
Mae Whitman, Lucy Liu, Raven-Symoné, Megan Hilty, Pamela Adlon, and Anjelica Huston reprise
their roles of Tinker Bell, Silvermist, Iridessa, Rosetta, Vidia and Queen Clarion.

18
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Ginnifer Goodwin joins the cast, replacing Angela Bartys as the voice of Fawn in
this film, Rosario Dawson joins the cast as new character Nyx.

19
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
Singer Mel B also joins the cast as new character Fury in the British
release while Danai Gurira voices her in the American release.

20
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
The film explores themes of fairy tale, fairy, tinkerbell.
